  "description": "A mediator whose pipeline steps are ordinary ASP.NET Core middleware. Send a request, it travels the real middleware chain and reaches your endpoint method, with no server, no port and no socket behind it. Production middleware runs unchanged. Built for running many web applications in one process as plain objects, isolated per DI scope.",
  "id": "Personix.Mediator.Middleware",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-30T07:10:46.887Z",
